  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Some drugs do not bind to the enzyme&rsquo;s active site. These bind to a different site of enzyme which is called allosteric site. This binding of inhibitor at allosteric site changes the shape of the active site in such a way that substrate cannot recognise it.&nbsp;</p><p>Non-competitive inhibitor changes the active site of enzyme after binding at allosteric site</p></blockquote>",
